{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27291","headline":"秋月悬清辉 · 蒋防","name":"秋月悬清辉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋月沿霄汉，亭亭委素辉。\n山明桂花发，池满夜珠归。\n入牖人偏揽，临枝鹊正飞。\n影连平野净，轮度晓云微。\n晶晃浮轻露，裴回映薄帷。\n此时千里道，延望独依依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}